0:{"buildId":"A2KDDaJI2Oei_cuPJJym6","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Admissions"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Why Choosing the Right Master’s Program Matters More Than Ever"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"Every year, thousands of students, especially from India, reach the same point in their academic journey and ask the same question:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","Which master’s program is right for me?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Which master’s program is right for me?"}],[["$","p","It sounds like a straightforward question, but anyone who has actually gone through the process knows it rarely feels simple.",{"children":"It sounds like a straightforward question, but anyone who has actually gone through the process knows it rarely feels simple."}],["$","p","There are rankings, university websites, social media opinions, counsellor recommendations, family expectations, career pressure, and, somewhere in the middle of all that noise, your own uncertainty. For many students, the process begins with excitement and quickly turns into confusion. And that is understandable. According to QS,",{"children":"There are rankings, university websites, social media opinions, counsellor recommendations, family expectations, career pressure, and, somewhere in the middle of all that noise, your own uncertainty. For many students, the process begins with excitement and quickly turns into confusion. And that is understandable. According to QS,"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","45% of prospective international students consider five or more universities before making a final decision",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"45% of prospective international students consider five or more universities before making a final decision"}],[["$","p",", which tells you how crowded and complex this decision has become.",{"children":", which tells you how crowded and complex this decision has become."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","For Indian students, the stakes are even higher. The Ministry of External Affairs says that",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"For Indian students, the stakes are even higher. The Ministry of External Affairs says that"}],[["$","p","nearly 1.25 million Indian students were pursuing higher education abroad as of January 2025.",{"children":"nearly 1.25 million Indian students were pursuing higher education abroad as of January 2025."}],["$","p","That number reflects not just rising mobility, but also the scale of the decision students are trying to make in a highly competitive global education market.",{"children":"That number reflects not just rising mobility, but also the scale of the decision students are trying to make in a highly competitive global education market."}],["$","p","And yet, despite how important this choice is, many students still approach it backwards. They begin with brand names. They begin with rankings. They begin with what seems popular at the moment. But the best decisions are rarely made that way.",{"children":"And yet, despite how important this choice is, many students still approach it backwards. They begin with brand names. They begin with rankings. They begin with what seems popular at the moment. But the best decisions are rarely made that way."}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc"],"$Ld"]}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c"]}],"$L2d"]}]}],"$L2e"]}],["$L2f"],"$L30"]}],"isPartial":"$@31","staleTime":"$32","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L33","isPartial":"$@34","staleTime":"$32","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L35","isPartial":"$@36","staleTime":"$32","varyParams":"$37"},{"rsc":"$L38","isPartial":"$@39","staleTime":"$32","varyParams":"$37"},{"rsc":"$L3a","isPartial":"$@3b","staleTime":"$32","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@3c","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@3d"}
